        <Param val="Thank you for taking part in this study. Please read the information below.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What will I have to do?&amp;#10;You will read a few short texts and answer some questions about them&amp;#10;(for example, whether you think the text was written by a human or by&amp;#10;an AI system, and whether you would like to check it with an AI detector).&amp;#10;The study will take about 10–15 minutes.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Anonymity and data protection&amp;#10;We do not collect any identifying information about you.&amp;#10;Your responses will be stored under a random participant code and used&amp;#10;only for teaching/research purposes in anonymised form.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Voluntary participation&amp;#10;Your participation is completely voluntary.&amp;#10;You are free to stop the study at any time by closing this window,&amp;#10;without giving a reason and without any negative consequences.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Consent&amp;#10;By pressing SPACE below, you indicate your consent to participate.&amp;#10;" valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
